  "display_title": "The Countess Makes a Comeback",
  "description": "Rebecca once believed her husband, Count Zeppelin Devonshire, truly loved her. However, that changed when he took in a second wife and left Rebecca to die. Now she’s back in the past, once again his beautiful countess that he meticulously trapped in a suffocating life for their entire marriage. Fully aware of how he drove her to isolation and ruin, she’s determined to escape his cage and exact her revenge on him. With the help of Duke Julian Johannes, Rebecca is about to teach her captor what it’s like to be captured and destroyed.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
